==Trivia==
*Although Barriers were implemented in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]], audio and sprites for them could be found in the game's files as early as [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]]. The pre-release Barriers had a different design, which most notably was blue instead of red; this may have been changed so that they would be easier to see against the already-blue skin of their [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] bearers.
*Hitting a Barrier will not cause vibration when Battle Vibration is enabled.

